{"id":523,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"キリスト教教育と国際感覚の立教女学院","feature_description":"立教女学院はキリスト教の愛と奉仕を基盤に、国際的な教養と宗教的情操、自主性・自立性を育てる学校です。ARE学習や各教科の特色ある学び、礼拝やボランティア、土曜集会などを通して、自分で考え行動する姿勢を養います。中高の学校生活にはクラブ活動や国際プログラムも組み込まれ、日常の中で人間性を磨きます。少人数の環境で丁寧に学べる点も特徴で、落ち着いた校風が生徒を支えます。","clubs":[{"id":10273,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://hs.rikkyojogakuin.ac.jp/school-life/h_club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10274,"name":"水泳部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://hs.rikkyojogakuin.ac.jp/school-life/h_club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10275,"name":"ダンス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://hs.rikkyojogakuin.ac.jp/school-life/h_club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10276,"name":"テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://hs.rikkyojogakuin.ac.jp/school-life/h_club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10277,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://hs.rikkyojogakuin.ac.jp/school-life/h_club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10278,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://hs.rikkyojogakuin.ac.jp/school-life/h_club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10279,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://hs.rikkyojogakuin.ac.jp/school-life/h_club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10280,"name":"ハンドボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://hs.rikkyojogakuin.ac.jp/school-life/h_club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10281,"name":"陸上競技部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://hs.rikkyojogakuin.ac.jp/school-life/h_club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10282,"name":"科学部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://hs.rikkyojogakuin.ac.jp/school-life/h_club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10283,"name":"演劇部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://hs.rikkyojogakuin.ac.jp/school-life/h_club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10284,"name":"音楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://hs.rikkyojogakuin.ac.jp/school-life/h_club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":1